{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ResilientPaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallPlugin"},{"text":" populates ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallState"},{"text":" — and therefore the feature gate,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"account display, and whether the paywall sheet is shown — entirely from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"snapshots its wrapped service emits. A slow, silent, or throwing entitlement","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"read at cold launch leaves that state at its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"free"},{"text":" default. This decorator","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keeps a persisted last-known-good so the gate never collapses to free on a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"transient failure, while the server remains the authoritative gate: a later","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"live snapshot always overwrites the cache, so a genuine lapse is honoured.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The cache is bounded by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxCacheAge"},{"text":" (72 hours by default): a stale cache","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stops vouching for ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPro"},{"text":" — subscriptions lapse, and an install that stays","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"offline past the bound must not keep pro forever — but keeps","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasPermanentLicense"},{"text":", because lifetime purchases don’t expire.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Provider-agnostic by construction — it speaks only ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService"},{"text":", so it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wraps any base (simulated, RevenueCat, StoreKit, …). Feed the wrapped instance","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"both"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallPlugin"},{"text":" and any app-side reader that builds a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"monetization\/context payload from entitlements.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Back the cache with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyValueStore"},{"text":" rather than ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UserDefaults"},{"text":": the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cache vouches for a paid entitlement offline, and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UserDefaults"},{"text":" is a plist","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a user can edit or restore from a doctored backup, whereas the Keychain is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"encrypted and not plist-editable. (On unsigned macOS dev builds the Keychain","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can return ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"errSecMissingEntitlement"},{"text":" \/ −34018 — see ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sandboxing &"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entitlements (macOS)"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" on ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyValueStore"},{"text":".)","type":"text"}]},{"code":["let resilient = ResilientPaywallService(","    base: paywallService,","    store: KeychainKeyValueStore(service: \"com.example.myapp\")",")","\/\/ PaywallPlugin(..., service: resilient)   \/\/ gate + account display","\/\/ await resilient.currentSnapshot()        \/\/ server payload, off-main"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"level":2,"text":"Threat model","type":"heading","anchor":"Threat-model"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Backed by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyValueStore"},{"text":", the cache defends against casual plist","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"editing and a doctored-backup restore: the persisted last-known-good is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"encrypted and not a user-editable file. It does ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" defend against a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"jailbroken device — nothing client-side does; entitlements can always be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"forged on a device the attacker fully controls. The live provider stays","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"authoritative whenever the app is online: any live snapshot overwrites the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cache, so a genuine lapse or downgrade is honoured on the next successful","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"read. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasPermanentLicense"},{"text":" deliberately never expires — a lifetime purchase","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"must keep working offline indefinitely.","type":"text"}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall"]]},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":[